{"strings":["Declaration","Details related to any statement or action, in any form prescribed or accepted by the Government Agency, giving information or particulars required by the Governmental Agency.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document reference number, assigned by the Trader","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Submitter","Details related to the submitter of written or electronic documentation.","Submitter name","Name of the party who presents a document or data for the approval, consideration, or decision of another.","Submitter identifier","Identification of the party who presents a document or data for the approval, consideration, or decision of another.","International code list (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User code list","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Street and number/P.O. box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","User code list","Contact","Details related to contact information of a department or employee.","Department or employee contact name","Name of a department or employee.","Communication","Details related to communication including number and number type.","Communication identifier","Identification of the communication address.","Communication number type code","Code specifying the type of communication address.","CommunicationMeansTypeCodeList","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of identification of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of identifier of the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansIdentificationTypeCodeList","Type of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","Nationality of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying nationality of the active means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansRegistrationNationalityCodeList","Conveyance identifier","Identification of the journey of a means of transport, for example voyage number, flight number, trip number.","Transport means direction code","Code specifying the direction of the transport means (i.e., inbound or outbound).","TransportMeansDirectionCodeList","ArrivalLocation","Details related to the first arrival location.","Arrival port name","Name of the arrival location. This would be a port for sea, airport for air and border post for land crossing.","Port of arrival identifier","Identification of the arrival location. This would be a port for sea, airport for air and border post for land crossing.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","First port of arrival in customs territory date/time","Date and time of arrival (actual or scheduled) of the means of transport at the first port (e.g. seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station).","BerthLocation","Details related to the location of berth.","Berth location name","Name of the location in port where the means of transport will berth.","Berth location identifier","Identification of the location in port where the means of transport will berth.","UN/LOCODE + User codes","DepartureLocation","Details related to departure location.","Departure location name","Name of the departure location.","Departure location identifier","Identification of the place of departure of the goods.","Departure date/time","Date and time of departure of the means of transport.","Itinerary","Details related to the itinerary of the means of transport.","Itinerary location name","Name of a single port of call or other location in the itinerary of a means of transport.","Itinerary location identifier","Identification of a single port of call or other location of the itinerary of a means of transport.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Itinerary arrival date/time","Date and time of arrival at itinerary port of the means of transport.","Reservation","Details related to a reservation (e.g. seat number).","PNR identifier","Identification of the passenger by Passenger Name Record Locator Number (or unique identifier).","Cabin","Details related to the cabin.","Cabin identifier","Identification of the specific cabin or room on board.","Itinerary departure date/time","Date and time of departure at itinerary port of the means of transport.","Itinerary location type code","Code specifying the type of the itinerary location.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3227","PersonOnBoard","Details related to the person on board of a transport means.","Person on board identifier","Identification of the person on board.","Transit passenger indicator code","Code specifying if a person is a transit passenger.","TransitPassengerIndicatorCodeList","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document 